  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEAQE Mali-Teachers are trained to teach effectively</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teachers trained are applying inclusive education, child centred methodology, and child protection principles in their classrooms; teachers trained are teaching reading and mathematics skills effectively. This targets IDPs, refugees, host community children,  children with disabilities, minorities and those living in remote areas.</narrative>
  </description>
